<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Light 9-mo net profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Light 9-mo net profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's recently privatized Light distributor released the following nine-month 1996 net profit.</p>
<p>		     Jan-Sept 1996	Jan-Sept 1995</p>
<p>    Net profit	76.29 million	loss 59.9 million</p>
<p>    Revs		 1.16 bln	     916.8 million</p>
<p>    Share profit     0.00734	 loss 0.00576</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Brazilian reais and not adjusted for inflation.</p>
<p>-- James Craig, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 248 5413</p>
</text>
